name: Wily Joker — three-of-a-kind chips
author: corpus
description: >-
  Wily Joker gives +100 Chips if the hand contains Three of a Kind (Full House too).
  First-shop trips chips: the chip counterpart to Zany Joker — pair them on the same
  trips, level with Venus.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: WilyJoker
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: ZanyJoker
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 35
  - joker: TheTrio
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - planetCard: Venus
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 20
